# Adlaire-Design Admin UI Catalog

This catalog governs Admin-only UI patterns used by administrators, operators, editors, reviewers, and maintainers.

`Docs/Master_Spec` is the higher-level source of truth.

## Scope

| Owns | Does not own |
| --- | --- |
| Admin dashboard UI | Generic public-only UI |
| Settings and data-list UI | WYSIWYG Editor UI |
| Bulk action and danger-zone UI | Official SVG icon files |
| Permission, role, scope, audit, and security UI | Editor runtime internals |
| Admin layout and responsive policy | Brand asset files |

